B.a0F=s(["Roads are fresh. Ride safe today.","Morning orders are coming in. Go online to catch them."],t.s)
B.a_v=s(["Lunch deliveries are rolling in. Stay hydrated out there.","Every delivery counts. Keep it smooth and safe."],t.s)
